y":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids February to March and March to April each came in under 90% of normal in 41 of them. In 2025 the middle got 4% of normal in February to March and 37% in November to December. So far in 2026 the middle shows 43% in March to April and 108% in June to July. Every grid had its driest year in 2011, with grid 14814 at 25%.</p>"}
